sequenceDiagram
    participant Server as Polar git server
    participant Cassini
    participant Observer as Scheduler observer
    participant Processor as Scheduler processor
    participant Graph as Neo4j
    participant Target as Target agent
    participant CA as ConfigurationActor (in the target)

    Server-)Cassini: RepoChanged
    Cassini-)Observer: RepoChanged (for its repository)
    Observer->>Server: git pull --ff-only (mTLS, workload certificate)
    Observer->>Observer: evaluate the item, refuse an import
    opt early check, same rules as the target's
        Observer->>Observer: verify, drop and log if invalid
    end
    Observer-)Cassini: GitScheduleChange {whole document}
    Cassini-)Processor: GitScheduleChange
    Processor->>Graph: upsert the schedule node (document stored as received)
    Processor-)Cassini: ScheduleNotification {whole document} on agent.<id>.schedule
    Cassini-)Target: ScheduleNotification
    Target->>CA: submit(document)

    Note over Target,CA: verifies for itself, in order
    CA->>CA: 1. two fields only, no import
    CA->>CA: 2. chain to pinned CA, cert valid
    CA->>CA: 3. signature over the payload, then read it
    CA->>CA: 4. addressed to this agent
    CA->>CA: 5. signer holds c:update-policy
    CA->>CA: 6. not revoked (hook only)
    CA->>CA: 7. version above the last
    alt every check passes
        CA->>CA: apply: all or none
        CA-)Target: ConfigChanged {version, names}
        Target->>CA: current() and use the new values
        CA->>CA: record names, never values
    else any check fails
        CA->>CA: refuse whole, keep old values
        Note over CA: author not told yet (open)
    end
